        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Nourish Body Wash Ingredients</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<p>\nSodium C14 - C16 Olefin Sulfonate<br>\n(coconut-based cleanser), <br><br>\n\nCocamidopropyl Betaine (coconut-based cleanser), <br><br>\n\nCocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (coconut-based lather), <br><br>\n\nCoco Glucoside (plant-based, hydrating cleanser), <br><br>\n\nDL-Panthenol (pro-vitamin B5), <br><br>\n\nGlycerin (plant-based, satin feel), <br><br>\n\nSodium Gluconate (mineral cleanser),<br><br>\n\nCaprylyl Capryl Glucoside (plant-based cleanser), <br><br>\n\nAloe Barbadensis (Aloe) Leaf Juice (base hydrator), <br><br>\n\nOat Hydrolysate PF [Hydrolyzed Oat Protein] (skin conditioning), <br><br>\n\nHedychium Coronarium (Awapuhi) Extract (adds softness), <br><br>\n\nAlthaea Officinalis (Marshmallow Root) Extract (helps sooth skin), <br><br>\n\nCucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract (refreshes &amp; hydrates), <br><br>\n\nCitric Acid (pH balancer),<br><br>\n\nPolysorbate 20 [food-grade] (plant-based, oil emulsifier), <br><br>\n\nPolyquaternium 10 (plant-based, softens),<br><br>\n\nCaprylyl Glycol (plant-based formula support), <br><br>\n\nPhenoxyethanol (gentle preserver), <br><br>\n\nSodium Chloride (softening support), <br><br>\n\nEssential Oils (scent)<br><br>\n\nLimonene (natural component of<br>\nessential oils)<br><br>\n\nLearn more about these ingredients on our blog.\n</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Scent Ingredients",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "<div id=\"nourish-scent-profiles\">\n\n  <p>\n    Nourish Botanicals’ scents are made with Pure Essential Oils • hand selected by us from small farms all around the world.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"scent-block\">\n    <h3>Cottage Garden</h3>\n\n    <p>\n      Pure essential oils of lavender, sage, and rosemary come together in this serene, herbaceous blend. Soft floral notes calm the spirit, while crisp greens and bright aromatics bring freshness and vitality. Gentle and grounding, Cottage Garden transforms everyday care into a peaceful retreat.\n    </p>\n\n    <p><strong>Scent Ingredients:</strong><br>\n      Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Oil, \n      Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Oil, \n      Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"scent-block\">\n    <h3>Viridian Grove</h3>\n\n    <p>\n      Viridian Grove is a sophisticated fusion of pure essential oils, refreshing the body and centering the mind. Bright bergamot uplifts with clean energy, cedarwood lends a warm, woody depth, and sage offers herbal clarity. Crisp yet grounding, it restores balance and connection to nature.\n    </p>\n\n    <p><strong>Scent Ingredients:</strong><br>\n      Citrus Bergamia (Bergamot) Fruit Oil, \n      Cedrus Atlantica (Cedarwood) Oil, \n      Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Oil\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"scent-block\">\n    <h3>Unscented</h3>\n\n    <p>Contains no added scent</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
